desc:
Caspian Corporate Services Ltdhas informed BSE that the meeting of the Board of Directors of the Company is scheduled on 04/09/2026 ,inter alia, to consider and approve 1. To take note of the Secretarial Audit Report of the company for the Financial Year 2025-26;
2. To consider and approve the Director' Report along with the annexures attached thereto for the Financial Year ended 31st March, 2026;
3. To fix the day, date, time &amp; place for convening the 15th Annual General Meeting of the company and other related matters;
4. To consider and approve the Draft Notice for the 15th Annual General Meeting of the company for circulation to the members of the company;
5. To fix the date of closure of Register of Members and Share Transfer Books of the Company for the purpose of 15th Annual General Meeting;
6. To appoint a scrutinizer to ascertain the voting process of 15th Annual General Meeting (AGM);
